# 
# aerc Catppuccin Mocha colors — layered on top of the "base" styleset
# (see stylesets-dirs/styleset-name in aerc.conf). Colors only; no
# structural (bold/reverse/default) attributes here.
#
# default.bg is intentionally UNSET (not "default.bg=#1e1e2e"): leaving
# the base canvas background unset means aerc paints no explicit color
# there, so foot's terminal transparency/alpha shows through uniformly
# instead of a solid opaque rectangle behind all text.

